# Purpose

This document defines the billing engineering standards for the hubIO platform.

Its purpose is to establish architectural principles for representing commercial relationships, subscription lifecycle, and platform monetization while preserving business integrity, customer trust, and long-term product scalability.

---

# Scope

This standard defines:

* Billing philosophy
* Commercial ownership
* Subscription lifecycle
* Billing consistency
* Commercial governance
* Billing evolution

It intentionally excludes payment gateways, taxation rules, accounting systems, pricing implementation, and provider-specific billing technologies, which are defined by their respective Engineering Standards.

---

# Constitutional Interpretation

This document extends the hubIO Engineering Constitution.

It applies constitutional engineering principles to commercial operations, ensuring monetization remains aligned with product architecture while preserving customer trust and operational consistency.

